{# https://www.home-assistant.io/docs/configuration/templating/#reusing-templates #}

{#
End of the "just settled into nap" window: the point where the bedlamp stops being
force-dimmed on turn-on, and automations switch to assuming she might be waking up.
Also the start of the window where disabling sleep mode restores the lamp to normal
brightness (paired with input_datetime.baby_nap_end_time as that window's end).

Clamped to the nap end so that a nap shorter than 75 minutes degrades sanely: without the
clamp the force-dim window would run past nap end (dimming the lamp "Child Nap Wake-up
Time" turns on) and the restore/safety windows that start here would invert and never open.

:returns: A time value, 75 minutes after input_datetime.baby_nap_start_time, but never
          later than input_datetime.baby_nap_end_time.
#}
{%- macro nap_restore_start_time(returns) -%}
  {%- do returns(min((states('input_datetime.baby_nap_start_time') | today_at) + timedelta(minutes=75),
                     states('input_datetime.baby_nap_end_time') | today_at).time()) -%}
{%- endmacro -%}

{#
End of the "whole night" forced-dim window, and the start of the (narrower) window where
we proactively ask whether to disable sleep mode.

:returns: A time value, 630 minutes (10.5 hours) after input_datetime.baby_bedtime_start_time.
#}
{%- macro bedtime_ask_disable_start_time(returns) -%}
  {%- do returns(((states('input_datetime.baby_bedtime_start_time') | today_at) + timedelta(minutes=630)).time()) -%}
{%- endmacro -%}

{#
Start of the morning "waking up" period: resumes motion alerts and opens the window where
disabling sleep mode restores the lamp to normal brightness. A grace buffer before
her actual wake-up time.

:returns: A time value, 30 minutes before input_datetime.baby_wake_up_time.
#}
{%- macro bedtime_morning_transition_start_time(returns) -%}
  {%- do returns(((states('input_datetime.baby_wake_up_time') | today_at) - timedelta(minutes=30)).time()) -%}
{%- endmacro -%}

{#
The nap part of the nursery alert window.

Consumed by in_nursery_alert_window, and by "Notify When Motion Detected In The Nursery",
to tell when the nap began.

:returns: True if now is between input_datetime.baby_nap_start_time and
          input_datetime.baby_nap_end_time.
#}
{%- macro in_nursery_nap_window() -%}
  {%- set now_time = now().time() -%}
  {%- set nap_start = (states('input_datetime.baby_nap_start_time') | today_at).time() -%}
  {%- set nap_end = (states('input_datetime.baby_nap_end_time') | today_at).time() -%}
  {{- nap_start <= now_time <= nap_end -}}
{%- endmacro -%}

{#
The morning part of the nursery alert window, relative to OUR wake-up time, not the child's.

Consumed by in_nursery_alert_window.

:returns: True if now is from 15 minutes before input_datetime.wake_up_time until 30 minutes
          after it.
#}
{%- macro in_nursery_morning_window() -%}
  {%- set now_time = now().time() -%}
  {%- set morning_start = ((states('input_datetime.wake_up_time') | today_at) - timedelta(minutes=15)).time() -%}
  {%- set morning_end = ((states('input_datetime.wake_up_time') | today_at) + timedelta(minutes=30)).time() -%}
  {{- morning_start <= now_time <= morning_end -}}
{%- endmacro -%}

{#
The bedtime part of the nursery alert window.

Consumed by in_nursery_alert_window, and by "Notify When Motion Detected In The Nursery",
to tell when the night began.

:returns: True if now is between input_datetime.baby_bedtime_start_time and
          input_datetime.lights_out_time.
#}
{%- macro in_nursery_bedtime_window() -%}
  {%- set now_time = now().time() -%}
  {%- set bedtime_start = (states('input_datetime.baby_bedtime_start_time') | today_at).time() -%}
  {%- set lights_out = (states('input_datetime.lights_out_time') | today_at).time() -%}
  {{- bedtime_start <= now_time <= lights_out -}}
{%- endmacro -%}

{#
The window during which nursery motion is worth alerting on: she's in bed and we're out of
the room. Deliberately independent of input_boolean.baby_sleep_mode, which means "actually
asleep" and so is off during exactly the settling-in period we most want to hear about.

Consumed by "Notify When Motion Detected In The Nursery", to decide when to alert, and by
"Turn On Bedroom Bedlamp When Sleep Mode Disabled", to decide when ending the session must
restore the lamp.

:returns: True if now falls in the nap, bedtime or morning window.
#}
{%- macro in_nursery_alert_window() -%}
  {{- in_nursery_nap_window() | bool or
      in_nursery_bedtime_window() | bool or
      in_nursery_morning_window() | bool -}}
{%- endmacro -%}

{#
Which part of the nap or night schedule we're in, for the nursery bed check and sleep mode.
Only the clock: whether she's actually asleep is sleep mode's job.
- sleep: from 15 minutes before the start (the outer padding, since she's often put
  down early) until 30 minutes before the end
- wake_up: from 30 minutes before the end (the waking lead) until 15 minutes after it
  (the outer padding again), when she's most likely to get up, so it's checked more often

When a short nap leaves no sleep time, it's all wake-up time.

:returns: sleep, wake_up, or none outside naps and nights.
#}
{%- macro get_sleep_phase() -%}
  {%- set now_time = now().time() -%}
  {%- set outer_padding_delta = timedelta(minutes=15) -%}
  {%- set waking_lead_delta = timedelta(minutes=30) -%}
  {%- set nap_start = states('input_datetime.baby_nap_start_time') | today_at -%}
  {%- set nap_end = states('input_datetime.baby_nap_end_time') | today_at -%}
  {%- set night_start = states('input_datetime.baby_bedtime_start_time') | today_at -%}
  {%- set wake_up = states('input_datetime.baby_wake_up_time') | today_at -%}
  {%- if ((nap_end - waking_lead_delta).time() <= now_time <= (nap_end + outer_padding_delta).time()) or
         ((wake_up - waking_lead_delta).time() <= now_time <= (wake_up + outer_padding_delta).time()) -%}
    {{- 'wake_up' -}}
  {%- elif ((nap_start - outer_padding_delta).time() <= now_time <= nap_end.time()) or
           now_time >= (night_start - outer_padding_delta).time() or now_time <= wake_up.time() -%}
    {{- 'sleep' -}}
  {%- else -%}
    {{- 'none' -}}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
